# SheetPage needs no API keys.
#
# Both serverless functions run without credentials:
#   /api/gsheets — fetches public / link-shared Google Sheets exports
#   /api/share   — stores share snapshots in Netlify Blobs, which Netlify
#                  configures automatically for the site's own deploys
#
# Deployment does need two GitHub Actions secrets (repository settings →
# Secrets and variables → Actions), not a .env file:
#   NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN   Netlify personal access token
#   NETLIFY_SITE_ID      the Netlify site's API ID

# ── Optional: serve the app from a sub-path instead of the domain root ───────
# Leave blank for a normal Netlify deployment.
VITE_BASE_PATH=
